      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Celoron%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Lucille Ball spent her teenage years in Celoron, and the village now features a memorial park with her statue.",
